  "bodyHash": "9245de9aee72c0d6",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lUuE4jX.png\" alt=\"矿石生长横幅\" width=\"1110\" height=\"351\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>矿石生长</strong> 允许水晶簇在矿石上生长！随后可以收获这些水晶簇来获取资源。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJlpisR.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>默认配置</strong></h4>\n<h5>默认情况下，水晶可以在所有原版矿石以及远古残骸上生长。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOOwZGx.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>自定义配方</strong></h4>\n<h5>矿石生长完全支持自定义，自定义配方可以让水晶在特定方块上生长。可以通过数据包添加新配方或调整默认配方。</h5>\n<h5>要添加配方，只需在数据包中创建一个新的配方文件，并将其类型设置为 `oregrowth:ore_growth`。以下是让水晶在南瓜上生长的矿石生长配方属性示例：</h5>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:20px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h6 style=\"background-color:rgba(67,73,86,0.8);border:5px solid rgba(67,73,86,0.8)\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">{</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"type\": \"oregrowth:ore_growth\",</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"base\": [</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"minecraft:pumpkin\"</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;], <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 水晶生长的方块</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"stages\": 4, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 水晶的生长阶段数，最多 4 个阶段</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"spawn_chance\": 0.2, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 基座方块获得随机刻时水晶生成的概率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"growth_chance\": 0.3, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 水晶获得随机刻时生长的概率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;\"drops\": [</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"stage\": 4, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 此掉落的生长阶段，也可以指定 'min_stage' 和 'max_stage'</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"chance\": 0.9, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 可选，获取此掉落的概率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"item\": {</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"id\": \"minecraft:pumpkin_pie\",</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"count\": 2</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;}</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; },</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"min_stage\": 1, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 此掉落的最小阶段</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"max_stage\": 3, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 此掉落的最大阶段</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"chance\": 0.3, <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 可选，获取此掉落的概率</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\"loot_table\": \"minecraft:blocks/short_grass\" <span style=\"color:#cfc\">// 用于获取物品的战利品表</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp;]</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">}</span></h6>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:20px\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Sp2j1Yl.png\" alt=\"水晶在南瓜上生长\" width=\"335\" height=\"415\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>为方便起见，配置文件中提供了禁用所有默认配方的选项，以及缩放所有矿石生长配方的生成概率和生长概率的选项。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bDXpr0y.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>配方查看器集成</strong></h4>\n<h5>所有矿石生长配方均可在配方查看类模组中显示。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eURhlC2.gif\" alt=\"JEI 中的矿石生长配方示例\" width=\"404\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJlpisR.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Jade 与 The One Probe 集成</strong></h4>\n<h5>Jade 和 The One Probe 都会显示水晶的生长进度。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/6M4iXVJ.png\" alt=\"显示水晶生长进度的 Jade 提示框\" width=\"400\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOOwZGx.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>模组兼容性</strong></h4>\n<h5>矿石生长兼容以下模组的矿石：</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/334/259/637467878829043643.png\" alt=\"附加方块：石版\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Additional Blocks: Stone Edition</strong></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/471/574/637760293478357857.png\" alt=\"BetterNether\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>BetterNether</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/471/575/637760294980874674.png\" alt=\"BetterEnd\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>BetterEnd</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/300/480/637357968773910837.png\" alt=\"更大的反应堆\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Bigger Reactors</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/393/435/637588742363737916.png\" alt=\"Create\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Create</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/832/437/638223405540661871.png\" alt=\"深天界\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Deep Aether</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/619/371/638006658643873232.png\" alt=\"Enderscape\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Enderscape</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/310/376/637398551210975973.png\" alt=\"极限反应堆\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Extreme Reactors</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/285/254/637300336290714863.png\" alt=\"宝石与珠宝\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Gems &amp; Jewels</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/292/719/637326741883981172.png\" alt=\"工业革命\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Industrial Revolution</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/492/672/637801316302309362.png\" alt=\"mekanism\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Mekanism</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/169/286/636714350437863347.png\" alt=\"神秘农业\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Mystical Agriculture</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/803/422/638168935805052874.png\" alt=\"神话金属\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Mythic Metals</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/371/724/637541818592011791.png\" alt=\"Pigsteel\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Pigsteel</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/249/665/637174779164720984.png\" alt=\"Powah\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Powah</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/22/510/635743559787349935.png\" alt=\"RFTools\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>RFTools</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/868/743/638283333991324018.png\" alt=\"洞穴探险\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;Spelunkery</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"天界\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>The Aether</strong></h5>\n<h5><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/416/888/637640074076654754.png\" alt=\"热力基础\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<strong>Thermal Foundation</strong></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bDXpr0y.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>常见问题</strong></h4>\n<h5><strong>这个模组是不是太强了？</strong></h5>\n<h5>是的，但可能没有你想象的那么夸张，因为水晶生长需要相当长的时间。例如，钻石矿石水晶可能需要 30 分钟到 1 小时才能完全生长。</h5>\n<h5><strong>我可以在整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong></h5>\n<h5>可以，欢迎在整合包中使用我的模组。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VJlpisR.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4>\n<h5>想要了解后续内容、即将推出的模组以及进行讨论，欢迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 服务器！</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord 加入按钮\" width=\"373\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cOOwZGx.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1199\" height=\"189\"></p>",
